### Existing Pipeline (Step-by-step)

| Step | Component | Action |
|------|-----------|--------|
| 1 | `DocumentController.java` | Receives file upload from frontend |
| 2 | [DocumentIngestionService.java](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/backend-java/src/main/java/com/sdlc/service/DocumentIngestionService.java) | Parses document (PDF/DOCX/TXT) → clean text |
| 3 | [McpAgentService.java](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/backend-java/src/main/java/com/sdlc/service/McpAgentService.java) | Calls MCP Host at `POST /execute` with `{ agent: "requirements-agent", arguments: { requirement_text, job_id } }` |
| 4 | [host.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/mcp-host/host.py) | Looks up `requirements-agent` in [agent_registry.yaml](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/mcp-host/agent_registry.yaml), spawns `venv/Scripts/python.exe server.py`, passes JSON via stdin |
| 5 | `requirements-agent/server.py` | Reads stdin → invokes LangGraph ([generate](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/graph.py#19-51) → [validate](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/graph.py#60-67) loop) → writes JSON to stdout |
| 6 | [host.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/mcp-host/host.py) | Captures stdout, returns `ExecuteResponse { status, metadata }` |
| 7 | [McpAgentService.java](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/backend-java/src/main/java/com/sdlc/service/McpAgentService.java) | Extracts [user_stories](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/server.py#11-35) from metadata |
| 8 | [DocumentIngestionService.java](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/backend-java/src/main/java/com/sdlc/service/DocumentIngestionService.java) | Uploads `_parsed.md` and `_user_stories.md` to user's GitHub repo |

### Key Agent Pattern (from `requirements-agent`)

Every agent follows this contract:

```
┌──────────────┐    stdin (JSON)     ┌──────────────┐
│   host.py    │ ──────────────────> │  server.py   │
│              │ <────────────────── │              │
└──────────────┘   stdout (JSON)     └──────────────┘
```

- **Input** (stdin): `{ "requirement_text": "...", "job_id": "..." }`
- **Output** (stdout): `{ "status": "success", "result": {...}, "tech_spec": "..." }`
- **LLM**: HuggingFace `Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct` via `InferenceClient`
- **Graph**: LangGraph `StateGraph` with generate → validate → retry loop (max 3 attempts)
- **Schema**: Pydantic `BaseModel` with validators for output integrity

