## 4. Tech Specs Agent — Internal Architecture

### 4.1 LangGraph State Machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Generate
    Generate --> Validate
    Validate --> Success: Valid
    Validate --> Generate: Invalid & attempts < 3
    Validate --> Error: Invalid & attempts >= 3
    Success --> [*]
    Error --> [*]
```

The agent mirrors the proven pattern from `requirements-agent`:

1. **Generate** — Sends a structured prompt to the LLM with the requirement text + user stories, asking for a tech spec in strict JSON format matching the Pydantic schema.
2. **Validate** — Parses the LLM output with Pydantic. If validation fails, retries (up to 3 attempts).
3. **Output** — Produces a structured `TechSpecArtifact` that gets formatted into Markdown.

### 4.2 Input & Output Contract

**Input** (received via stdin from [host.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/mcp-host/host.py)):

```json
{
  "requirement_text": "The system shall support user registration...",
  "user_stories": "# Generated User Stories\n## US01\n...",
  "job_id": "job_1739..."
}
```

**Output** (written to stdout as JSON):

```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "tech_spec": "# Technical Specification\n## 1. System Overview\n...",
  "result": {
    "system_overview": { "name": "...", "description": "...", "architecture_pattern": "..." },
    "data_model": { "entities": [...] },
    "api_design": { "endpoints": [...] },
    "components": [...],
    "non_functional_requirements": { "performance": {...}, "security": {...} },
    "tech_stack": { "frontend": "...", "backend": "...", "database": "..." },
    "risks_and_mitigations": [...],
    "open_questions": [...]
  }
}
```

### 4.3 Pydantic Output Schema (`TechSpecArtifact`)

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class TechSpecArtifact {
        +SystemOverview system_overview
        +DataModel data_model
        +APIDesign api_design
        +List~Component~ components
        +NonFunctionalRequirements nfrs
        +TechStack tech_stack
        +List~Risk~ risks_and_mitigations
        +List~str~ open_questions
    }

    class SystemOverview {
        +str name
        +str description
        +str architecture_pattern
        +List~str~ key_decisions
    }

    class DataModel {
        +List~Entity~ entities
    }

    class Entity {
        +str name
        +List~EntityField~ fields
        +List~str~ relationships
    }

    class APIDesign {
        +List~APIEndpoint~ endpoints
    }

    class APIEndpoint {
        +str method
        +str path
        +str description
        +str request_body
        +str response_body
    }

    class Component {
        +str name
        +str responsibility
        +List~str~ depends_on
    }

    class NonFunctionalRequirements {
        +str performance
        +str security
        +str scalability
        +str availability
    }

    class TechStack {
        +str frontend
        +str backend
        +str database
        +str infrastructure
    }

    class Risk {
        +str risk
        +str impact
        +str mitigation
    }

    TechSpecArtifact --> SystemOverview
    TechSpecArtifact --> DataModel
    TechSpecArtifact --> APIDesign
    TechSpecArtifact --> Component
    TechSpecArtifact --> NonFunctionalRequirements
    TechSpecArtifact --> TechStack
    TechSpecArtifact --> Risk
    DataModel --> Entity
    APIDesign --> APIEndpoint
```

