## 5. End-to-End Flow (With Tech Specs Agent)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Java Backend
    participant MCP as MCP Host
    participant RA as Requirements Agent
    participant TSA as Tech Specs Agent
    participant GH as GitHub

    User->>FE: Upload document
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/documents/upload

    Note over BE: Stage 1-3: Parse document
    BE->>BE: Extract text from PDF/DOCX/TXT

    Note over BE: Stage 4: Generate User Stories
    BE->>MCP: POST /execute {agent: "requirements-agent"}
    MCP->>RA: subprocess (stdin JSON)
    RA->>RA: LangGraph: generate → validate
    RA-->>MCP: stdout JSON (user stories)
    MCP-->>BE: ExecuteResponse

    Note over BE: Stage 5: Generate Tech Specs ⭐ NEW
    BE->>MCP: POST /execute {agent: "tech-specs-agent"}
    MCP->>TSA: subprocess (stdin JSON)
    TSA->>TSA: LangGraph: generate → validate
    TSA-->>MCP: stdout JSON (tech spec)
    MCP-->>BE: ExecuteResponse

    Note over BE: Stage 6: Upload to GitHub
    BE->>GH: Upload _parsed.md
    BE->>GH: Upload _user_stories.md
    BE->>GH: Upload _tech_spec.md ⭐ NEW
    GH-->>BE: File URLs
    BE-->>FE: SSE: Job Completed
    FE-->>User: Show results + links
```

