## 7. Proposed Changes (File-by-File)

### Python Agent (New Files)

---

#### [NEW] [server.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/tech_specs_agent/server.py)

Entry point. Reads JSON from stdin, invokes the LangGraph, formats output as Markdown, writes JSON to stdout. Mirrors [requirements_agent/server.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/server.py).

#### [NEW] [graph.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/tech_specs_agent/graph.py)

LangGraph `StateGraph` with two nodes: [generate](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/graph.py#19-51) (LLM prompt) and [validate](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/graph.py#60-67) (Pydantic parse). Conditional edge for retry on validation failure.

#### [NEW] [llm.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/tech_specs_agent/llm.py)

HuggingFace LLM wrapper reusing the same `Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct` model. Copy of [requirements_agent/llm.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/llm.py).

#### [NEW] [tech_spec.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/tech_specs_agent/schemas/tech_spec.py)

Pydantic models: `TechSpecArtifact`, `SystemOverview`, `DataModel`, `Entity`, `APIDesign`, `APIEndpoint`, `Component`, `NonFunctionalRequirements`, `TechStack`, `Risk`. Includes semantic validators (e.g., at least one entity, every component must have a responsibility).

#### [NEW] [utils.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/tech_specs_agent/utils.py)

File I/O helpers. Copy of [requirements_agent/utils.py](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/requirements_agent/utils.py).

#### [NEW] [requirements.txt](file:///c:/Users/Vishal.bhardwaj/SDLC/Agentic_Sys/Agentic_Sys/agents/tech_specs_agent/requirements.txt)

Dependencies: `langgraph`, `pydantic`, `huggingface-hub`, `python-dotenv`.

